# Database Schema & Indexing Rules

- Use `scryfall_id` (UUID) as the primary foreign key across all user lot tables; map `mtgjson_uuid` and `tcgplayer_id` on `card_catalog`.
- Store all currency columns as `NUMERIC(10, 2)` in PostgreSQL.
- Required tables: `card_catalog`, `user_routing_profiles`, `collection_lots`, and `lot_items`.
- Always maintain composite index `idx_card_lookup ON card_catalog (LOWER(set_code), collector_number)` and `idx_tcgplayer_id ON card_catalog (tcgplayer_id)`.
